DESCRIPTION:Get in the spooky spirit all month long!\n\nIt's spooky season
 ! Pumpkins After Dark is Canada’s award-winning outdoor Halloween event.
  Featuring over 6\,000+ hand-carved pumpkins\, this one-of-a-kind walk-thr
 ough experience is the must-see event of the fall season. Pumpkins are han
 d-carved by Canadian artists\, have completely new designs every year\, an
 d the extravagant show takes nearly a year to plan and create.\n\nExplore 
 the magical kilometre-long pathway of lit pumpkin sculptures\, with music\
 , sounds and special effects. This family-friendly event is full of beauti
 ful Insta-worthy photo ops\, plenty of wow-pieces to witness\, and has no 
 jump-scares in the experience so your little ones can attend!\n\nThis ench
 anting and spooky experience runs all October from Thursday to Sunday afte
 r sunset (open times vary by date).\n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nSchedule: Thursd
 ay\, October 16\, 2025 at 6:15 AM–10:00 PM\nLocation: Borden Park - 1102
 0 75A Street\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nExplore Edmonton: https://exploree
 dmonton.com/event-calendar/pumpkins-after-dark
LAST-MODIFIED:20260902T043301Z
LOCATION:Borden Park - 11020 75A Street\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/pumpkins-after-dark
