X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>Get in the spooky spirit all month long!</
 p><p>It&#x27\;s spooky season! Pumpkins After Dark is Canada’s award-win
 ning outdoor Halloween event. Featuring over 6\,000+ hand-carved pumpkins\
 , this one-of-a-kind walk-through experience is the must-see event of the 
 fall season. Pumpkins are hand-carved by Canadian artists\, have completel
 y new designs every year\, and the extravagant show takes nearly a year to
  plan and create.</p><p>Explore the magical kilometre-long pathway of lit 
 pumpkin sculptures\, with music\, sounds and special effects. This family-
 friendly event is full of beautiful Insta-worthy photo ops\, plenty of wow
 -pieces to witness\, and has no jump-scares in the experience so your litt
 le ones can attend!</p><p>This enchanting and spooky experience runs all O
 ctober from Thursday to Sunday after sunset (open times vary by date).</p>
 <h3>Event Information</h3><ul><li><strong>Schedule:</strong> Sunday\, Octo
 ber 19\, 2025 at 6:45 AM–10:00 PM</li><li><strong>Location:</strong> Bor
 den Park - 11020 75A Street\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA</li><li><strong>Expl
 ore Edmonton:</strong> https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/pumpkins
 -after-dark</li></ul>
X-IMAGE:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/feature/Pumpkins-After-D
 ark1.jpg
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-ALLDAYEVENT:FALSE
END:VEVENT
